<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="531295890"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1337607311"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hey"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="智珉"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Hey"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:54.493"><div begin="00:03.150" end="02:51.296"><p begin="00:03.150" end="00:08.851" itunes:key="L1">Hey, oh-oh-oh, J-I-M-I-N<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 智珉</span></p><p begin="00:08.875" end="00:11.775" itunes:key="L2">Yeah, you ready? Let's go!</p><p begin="00:11.811" end="00:15.213" itunes:key="L3">뭘 그리 고민해 도대체 뭐가 문제야 Baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为何如此焦虑</span></p><p begin="00:15.584" end="00:17.059" itunes:key="L4">Know what you want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你想要什么</span></p><p begin="00:17.268" end="00:20.693" itunes:key="L5">시치미 떼봤자 넌 Oh 다 티가 나 Baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装不知道</span></p><p begin="00:21.262" end="00:22.817" itunes:key="L6">Hurry up come over here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点到我身边来吧</span></p><p begin="00:23.584" end="00:28.355" itunes:key="L7">누가 보거나 말거나 뭐라 하거나 말거나<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁不明白</span></p><p begin="00:28.797" end="00:30.561" itunes:key="L8">I don't care, It's OK<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不在意 没什么</span></p><p begin="00:31.734" end="00:34.253" itunes:key="L9">그저 걸리는 대로 I do, do, do it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是这样</span></p><p begin="00:35.008" end="00:36.262" itunes:key="L10">Oh-eh, oh-eh, oh-eh</p><p begin="00:36.401" end="00:37.341" itunes:key="L11">뻔히 다 보여 넌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着你 一目了然</span></p><p begin="00:37.481" end="00:38.920" itunes:key="L12">Oh-eh, oh-eh, oh-eh</p><p begin="00:39.095" end="00:42.670" itunes:key="L13">숨기려 해 봤자 넌 어차피 다 손바닥 안이야<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试图隐藏自己的心意</span></p><p begin="00:43.077" end="00:45.503" itunes:key="L14">Tell me what you want (Say what?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我你想要什么</span></p><p begin="00:46.130" end="00:49.172" itunes:key="L15">Hey (Hey) 어서 이리 와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快到我身边来吧</span></p><p begin="00:49.416" end="00:51.912" itunes:key="L16">더는 빼지 말고 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别拒绝</span></p><p begin="00:52.121" end="00:54.153" itunes:key="L17">자꾸 날 애타게 하지 말고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我心急如焚</span></p><p begin="00:54.524" end="00:56.846" itunes:key="L18">Hey (Hey) Hey (Hey)</p><p begin="00:57.450" end="01:00.329" itunes:key="L19">Hey (Hey) 오늘은 나와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天</span></p><p begin="01:00.515" end="01:03.348" itunes:key="L20">몸이 가는 대로 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就要这样尽情摇摆</span></p><p begin="01:04.253" end="01:05.728" itunes:key="L21">Baby tell me what you want it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我你想要什么</span></p><p begin="01:06.007" end="01:08.375" itunes:key="L22">Hey (Hey) Hey (Hey)</p><p begin="01:08.990" end="01:11.185" itunes:key="L23">Baby hurry up 조금만 더 Turn it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 快点</span></p><p begin="01:11.486" end="01:13.460" itunes:key="L24">I just wanna be with you tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚 我只想</span></p><p begin="01:14.598" end="01:16.943" itunes:key="L25">Just suck it up baby, tell me what you want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">振作起来 宝贝 告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:17.349" end="01:19.590" itunes:key="L26">Yeah, I'm ready for you tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想要什么</span></p><p begin="01:20.217" end="01:22.795" itunes:key="L27">뻔히 다 보여 왜 자꾸 멀뚱멀뚱해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已擦亮双眼</span></p><p begin="01:23.062" end="01:25.639" itunes:key="L28">마주친 눈빛에도 넌 왜 긴가민가해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样相遇</span></p><p begin="01:25.802" end="01:29.528" itunes:key="L29">Hey 아까운 시간 흐르잖아 Tic-toc (Tic-toc)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已认定你</span></p><p begin="01:29.714" end="01:31.421" itunes:key="L30">기다리고 있잖아 어서 Cheer up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等你</span></p><p begin="01:32.071" end="01:34.428" itunes:key="L31">오늘 밤 네 앞에 나 절대 내숭 안 떨래요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">振作起来</span></p><p begin="01:34.579" end="01:37.144" itunes:key="L32">이미 알고 있잖아 나 여자 판 나폴레옹<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不会装模作样</span></p><p begin="01:37.342" end="01:39.873" itunes:key="L33">너와 나는 마치 Matilda and Leon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我和你</span></p><p begin="01:40.070" end="01:42.845" itunes:key="L34">완전 내 취향 저격이야 Ping!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="01:43.157" end="01:45.583" itunes:key="L35">Hey (Hey) 어서 이리 와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快到我身边来吧</span></p><p begin="01:45.792" end="01:49.101" itunes:key="L36">더는 빼지 말고 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样做</span></p><p begin="01:49.519" end="01:51.342" itunes:key="L37">자꾸 날 애타게 하지 말고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我心急如焚</span></p><p begin="01:51.667" end="01:54.082" itunes:key="L38">Hey (Hey) Hey (Hey)</p><p begin="01:54.709" end="01:57.797" itunes:key="L39">Hey (Hey) 오늘은 나와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天</span></p><p begin="01:58.145" end="02:00.584" itunes:key="L40">몸이 가는 대로 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快行动吧</span></p><p begin="02:01.419" end="02:02.731" itunes:key="L41">Baby tell me what you want it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我你想要什么</span></p><p begin="02:03.091" end="02:05.878" itunes:key="L42">Hey (Hey) Hey let's dance<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情摇摆吧</span></p><p begin="02:06.551" end="02:07.259" itunes:key="L43">(Hey, hey)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样 就这样尽情摇摆吧</span></p><p begin="02:08.130" end="02:08.374" itunes:key="L44">Do it, do it, do it like this</p><p begin="02:08.583" end="02:10.417" itunes:key="L45">(Hey, hey)</p><p begin="02:10.568" end="02:11.950" itunes:key="L46">Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情摇摆</span></p><p begin="02:12.170" end="02:13.262" itunes:key="L47">(Hey, hey)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">智珉</span></p><p begin="02:13.413" end="02:14.620" itunes:key="L48">J-I-M-I-N</p><p begin="02:15.003" end="02:17.000" itunes:key="L49">타고난 치명적임 누구를 탓해 uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的</span></p><p begin="02:17.778" end="02:18.892" itunes:key="L50">(Hey, hey)</p><p begin="02:19.043" end="02:20.530" itunes:key="L51">Do it, do it, do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样 就这样尽情摇摆吧</span></p><p begin="02:20.634" end="02:21.609" itunes:key="L52">(Hey, hey)</p><p begin="02:21.807" end="02:23.339" itunes:key="L53">Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情摇摆</span></p><p begin="02:23.548" end="02:24.349" itunes:key="L54">(Hey, hey)</p><p begin="02:24.535" end="02:25.766" itunes:key="L55">J-I-M-I-N<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">智珉</span></p><p begin="02:26.033" end="02:28.529" itunes:key="L56">You know my name? (God Jimin Diva)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我的名字</span></p><p begin="02:29.249" end="02:31.989" itunes:key="L57">Hey (Hey) 어서 이리 와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快到我身边来吧</span></p><p begin="02:32.232" end="02:34.821" itunes:key="L58">더는 빼지 말고 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样做</span></p><p begin="02:35.030" end="02:36.969" itunes:key="L59">자꾸 날 애타게 하지 말고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我心急如焚</span></p><p begin="02:37.283" end="02:40.069" itunes:key="L60">Hey (Hey) Hey (Hey)</p><p begin="02:40.232" end="02:43.436" itunes:key="L61">Hey (Hey) 오늘은 나와 Do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天 和我</span></p><p begin="02:43.831" end="02:46.292" itunes:key="L62">몸이 가는 대로 Just do it like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快行动吧</span></p><p begin="02:46.722" end="02:48.475" itunes:key="L63">Baby tell me what you want it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我你想要什么</span></p><p begin="02:48.777" end="02:51.296" itunes:key="L64">Hey (Hey) Hey (hey)</p></div></body></tt>